From 7b40608260e388da9ace651520b12567a2d72931 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:44:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add real-time air quality: pollutants, 24h forecast, live
 panel, geolocation

- data_source: O3/NO2/SO2/CO, observation time, main pollutant, hourly forecast,
  coordinate lookup, one retry, serve-last-reading-if-API-down (<=3h)
- insights: best time to go out (waking hours) and 6-hour trend
- assistant: refresh live data each turn, explain stricter advice, keep location
  typed alongside an AQI, user-supplied figures override live feed
- server: GET /api/live, coords in /api/chat, Permissions-Policy for geolocation,
  static max-age 24h -> 5min so UI updates reach browsers
- web: live conditions panel, forecast chart, 10-min auto-refresh, "Use my location"
- tests: 25 new (fake Open-Meteo payloads); full suite 70 passing

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013dt8LiRVaebM9pr7VP4C7T
